    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14407" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπρίξ</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fast, tight,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὄνυξι συλλαβών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					310
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχεσθαι τοῦ κερδαίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					328
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				15.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nec.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>VS</u>
				p.475
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖν χεροῖν λαβέσθαι τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					155e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.11.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν χείρεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					24.55
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράξασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.247
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., a kind of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκανθα</span> (<i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				132.53
			</span></i>.</div>
